{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（25日）上午11時49分，元朗安樂路近朗業街，一輛Audi私家車疑失事撞向一輛私家車，繼而剷上石壆，再撞毀一支交通告示牌。救援人員接報到場，30歲蔡姓男司機並無受傷，另一名被撞的私家車司機亦無受傷，二人在場接受檢查。</p><p>警方正調查意外起因。從網上圖片可見，涉事Audi私家車「擒」上石壆，車頭撞至損毀。</p><figure><img alt=\"涉事Audi私家車「擒」上石壆，車頭撞至損毀。（車cam L（香港群組）/白軍浪圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261125/1202267906998538240895103.jpeg/olZEs3GB7JqIQScF9x-_6jlRowwyHkBLN8GZUTfBmVE\"/><figcaption>涉事Audi私家車「擒」上石壆，車頭撞至損毀。（車cam L（香港群組）/白軍浪圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事Audi私家車「擒」上石壆，車頭撞至損毀。（ 元朗區議會議員李啟立Facebook圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261125/1202267741025996800814725.jpeg/sQ_4ZuZEN6QS6TXNCqDq8FichRQhuFAVSE1zu0hNc7s\"/><figcaption>涉事Audi私家車「擒」上石壆，車頭撞至損毀。（ 元朗區議會議員李啟立Facebook圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"拖車公司到場處理。（ 元朗區議會議員李啟立Facebook圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261125/1202267736248422400286917.jpeg/ZcMvMCmPVfHptqJDB72Z-qNxeY09e8XLt2xzCLdscwg\"/><figcaption>拖車公司到場處理。（ 元朗區議會議員李啟立Facebook圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"拖車公司到場處理。（ 元朗區議會議員李啟立Facebook圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261125/1202267738626723840291075.jpeg/Yw8AhW8OJhRT83RdT2NaPdNxHbjMlEUPdIfTeHSH03g\"/><figcaption>拖車公司到場處理。（ 元朗區議會議員李啟立Facebook圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T06:43:53.599741+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":310,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T06:36:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T12:05:34.291160+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T06:37:19.369615+00:00","content_hash":"d27296c42b3dbaac4f76928df53803dd13475591fcae3fa7d67a82980ab32861","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}